# WP3.9 D035 full-app visual fixture.
# Button ids: SEQ=11. Encoder ids: K1=2 K2=3 K3=4 K4=5.
# Host-only `effect STEP CMD VALUE` writes the stored FmtStep command/value and
# refreshes the already-verified D032 effect cache; it is not a firmware UI.

# Enter ordinary tracker view on pattern 0 / track 0.
100 btn 11

# Populate all eight visible rows with representative D032/D033 stored effects.
200 effect 0 1 55
210 effect 1 6 2
220 effect 2 7 3
230 effect 3 8 0
240 effect 4 5 47
250 effect 5 2 4
260 effect 6 3 165
270 effect 7 4 16

# Hold step 1 and create two locks. K4/PAN is last so the 1000 ms screenshot
# must show P2 on row 01 and storage-only detail in the footer.
300 keys 1
400 enc 2 -1
500 enc 5 1

# Release, then add one TRACK LEVEL lock on step 2 and release again.
1100 keys 0
1200 keys 4
1300 enc 4 -1
1400 keys 0

# By the 3000 ms screenshot no editor is active: row 01 must show L2, row 02
# L1, while all eight stored effect mnemonics remain visible.
3300 end
